3079:/*
3080: *  fsca_fpul_drn:  Sinus/cosinus approximation.
3081: *
3082: *  Note: This is an interesting instruction. It is not included in the SH4
3083: *  manual. Some googling indicated that this might be an SH4X instruction.
3084: *  On the other hand, it is used by Dreamcast code (and the Dreamcast has an
3085: *  SH4), and a cvs comment for gdb said that this is an SH4 instruction, not
3086: *  an SH4A instruction. Well well...
